sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Agent client
    participant A as Worker A
    participant B as Worker B
    Client->>A: Request a refund operation
    A-->>Client: input_required, inputRequests, requestState
    Note over A: Initial request finishes
    Client->>User: Ask for approval
    User-->>Client: Approve
    Client->>B: Retry with inputResponses and requestState
    Note over B: Verify state, caller, expiry, and operation.<br/>Enforce permission and replay controls.
    B-->>Client: Operation result
